[2026-10-05 10:46:20.429] 
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.429] ### Option: Server
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.464] #       List of comma delimited IP addresses, optionally in CIDR notation, or DNS n>
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.496] #       Incoming connections will be accepted only from the hosts listed here.
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.531] #       If IPv6 support is enabled then '127.0.0.1', '::127.0.0.1', '::ffff:127.0.0>
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.558] #       and '::/0' will allow any IPv4 or IPv6 address.
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.606] #       '0.0.0.0/0' can be used to allow any IPv4 address.
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.631] #       Example: Server=127.0.0.1,192.168.1.0/24,::1,2001:db8::/32,zabbix.example.c>
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.661] #
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.693] #   If left empty or not set will disable passive checks, and Zabbix agent 2 will n>
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.723] #
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.758] # Mandatory: no
[2026-10-05 10:46:20.784] # Default:
