[2026-10-05 10:46:25.320] ### Option: ServerActive
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.350] #       Zabbix server/proxy address or cluster configuration to get active checks f>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.396] #       Server/proxy address is IP address or DNS name and optional port separated >
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.417] #       Cluster configuration is one or more server or proxy group member addresses>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.441] #       Multiple Zabbix servers/clusters and Zabbix proxies can be specified, separ>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.498] #       Unless using proxy groups, more than one Zabbix proxy should not be specifi>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.534] #       If Zabbix proxy is specified then Zabbix server/cluster for that proxy shou>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.563] #       Multiple comma-delimited addresses can be provided to use several independe>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.587] #       If port is not specified, default port is used.
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.617] #       IPv6 addresses must be enclosed in square brackets if port for that host is>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.658] #       If port is not specified, square brackets for IPv6 addresses are optional.
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.685] #       If this parameter is not specified, active checks are disabled.
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.713] #       Example for Zabbix proxy:
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.741] #ServerActive=127.0.0.1:10051
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.776] #       Example for Zabbix proxy group:
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.806] #ServerActive=proxy1.example.com;proxy2.example.com;proxy3.example.c>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.853] #       Example for multiple servers:
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.882] #ServerActive=127.0.0.1:20051,zabbix.domain,[::1]:30051,::1,[12fc::1]
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.910] #       Example for high availability:
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.946] #ServerActive=zabbix.cluster.node1;zabbix.cluster.node2:20051;zabbix>
[2026-10-05 10:46:25.984] #       Example for high availability with two clusters and one server:
[2026-10-05 10:46:26.888] #ServerActive=zabbix.cluster.node1;zabbix.cluster.node2:20051,zabbix>
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.396] #
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.426] # Mandatory: no
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.459] # Default:
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.498] # ServerActive=
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.568] 
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.568] ServerActive=127.0.0.1:10050
[2026-10-05 10:46:27.627] 
